{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1817"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge sport-games/olympics","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/sport-games__olympics.g3.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",335],["+"," Aachen's show, held since 1924 and now staged in the Soers in the north of the city, is a CHIO – Concours Hippique International Officiel, the FEI category for official international shows that may host a Nations Cup – and stages Germany's Nations Cups in jumping, dressage, eventing and four-in-hand driving."],["=",85],["-","changes,"],["+","changes"],["=",1],["-","and"],["+","and,"],["=",7],["-","level"],["+","level,"],["=",1],["-","piaffe"],["+","passage"],["=",3],["-","passage"],["+","the"],["=",1],["+","piaffe, a cadenced trot-like movement on the spot "],["=",481]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",323],["+"," Das Turnier in Aachen, seit 1924 ausgetragen und heute in der Soers im Norden der Stadt zu Hause, ist ein CHIO – Concours Hippique International Officiel, die FEI-Kategorie für offizielle internationale Turniere mit Nationenpreis – und richtet Deutschlands Nationenpreise im Springen, in der Dressur, der Vielseitigkeit und im Vierspännerfahren aus."],["=",85],["-","Galoppwechsel,"],["+","Galoppwechsel"],["=",1],["+","und "],["=",4],["-","Piaffe"],["+","Passage"],["=",3],["-","Passage"],["+","Piaffe,"],["=",1],["+","eine taktmäßige trabartige Bewegung auf der Stelle "],["=",453]]}]},
